+## GTX 1660 and other 6 GB cards
+
+Branch `gtx1660`: defaults for 6 GB of video memory (`VICTORY_VRAM_TIER`), the title's
+output size (`VICTORY_OUTPUT`), FSR 1 at the present (`VICTORY_FSR`) and presets for a
+GTX 1660 on a 1080p screen (`Play-GTX1660.cmd`): [docs/GTX1660.ru.md](docs/GTX1660.ru.md)
+(in Russian). Not measured on such a card yet.
+
 ## How to run
 
 ```powershell
